  "findings": [
    "The current fixture routes and existing peer-disconnect/public Fetch collectors were Source-audited. The new collector uses genuine Node IncomingMessage completion instead of reusing the old permissive partial TCP decoder, and does not retarget private guest diagnostics/resource identity claims.",
    "Fixed3warmup+16measured cycles each execute6 declared calls,114total. The19 distinct context cookie/probe values are frozen and asserted, and emptycontext sends no inherited cookie/probe. Exact malformed JSON/fscrypto and stream predicates match unchanged fixture Source/contract.",
    "Normal success requires parsed HTTPcomplete plus consumer end/readableEnded, clean transport and observed Content-Length agreement. First-body local destroy intent and finalHTTPcomplete are independent; an alreadyparsed response is not relabeled peer truncation or guest cancellation. Expected post-intent reset errors are visible rather than required.",
    "Fresh agent:false sockets,20s call/2s cleanup/4MiB body/65536chunk/256KiB metadata caps and180s client budget are explicit. Known fully retained and closed failures remain semantic/protocol negatives; unknown close/publication/overflow or budget exhaustion stops the suffix and retains unattempted count.",
    "Reported cleanup-timeout race is corrected: final snapshots precede settled, observation handlers stop mutating after cutoff, timeout marks unretained tail unknown and late owned handles are handled/destroyed. Body/call/result/receipt publication preserves primary failures and verifies fsync/close/readback. No acceptance predicate or schedule changed.",
    "All3 actor deltas preserve genuine admitted newcomponent/composition/app and transport/copy/serve/bridge/capture/shutdown mechanisms. Child probeExecuted/collectionComplete/cleanupComplete are copied before status assertions; expected114calls/19cycles and new probe suite are checked.",
    "controlOnlytrue, browserAllowedfalse, RSCobserverpermissionfalse, fullOriginalfalse and fullNextfalse stay explicit. Legacy browser/tool data may remain documentary prerequisites without browser invocation. Cloud fullContractClientInvoked was corrected false and probeClientInvoked true before sealing.",
    "Binder reads baseline49f3 for exact component/envelope/app/tool roles only, never copies its protected array. Fresh closure uses unchanged genuine admission/source/app families plus single fixtureContract client consumer, new Source families and required direct module seams. Two None-first Source index slots are Rootbound exactly; plan inverses/rawpreimages/index counters and600/600/300 fresh owners persist.",
    "Prior-arm authority minimum now requires actual probe/collection/cleanup booleans with clean original owner. Root still independently reviews every completed collection/host/cleanup before proceeding; no automatic retry, fallback or hidden request is added."
  ],
